{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-worcestershire","content_id":"2fd49834-d091-4946-9073-96fa637a12d7","description":"This consultation seeks views on the local government reorganisation proposals we have received from councils in Worcestershire.​","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9339075","isbn":"","title":"Proposals for local government reorganisation in Worcestershire","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-worcestershire/proposals-for-local-government-reorganisation-in-worcestershire"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@communities.gov.uk","attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":488066,"filename":"Worcestershire_-_summary_and_analysis_of_consultation_responses.pdf","id":"9407406","isbn":"","number_of_pages":29,"title":"Worcestershire: Summary and analysis of consultation responses","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5f5319bc41483a25b676db/Worcestershire_-_summary_and_analysis_of_consultation_responses.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>We are seeking views on the proposals submitted by councils for the reorganisation of local government in Worcestershire.  </p>\n\n<p>​Responses to this consultation will inform our decision on which proposal, if any, to implement.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Summary and analysis of consultation responses added.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-21T15:36:09Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-05T13:30:00Z"}],"closing_date":"2026-03-26T23:59:00.000+00:00","emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9339075"],"final_outcome_attachments":["9407406"],"final_outcome_detail":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>The Secretary of State for Housing, Communities and Local Government has decided to implement, subject to Parliamentary approval, the proposal for 2 unitary councils to be established in Worcestershire.</p>\n\n<p>This proposal was submitted by:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Bromsgrove District Council</li>\n  <li>Malvern Hills District Council</li>\n  <li>Redditch Borough Council</li>\n  <li>Worcester City Council</li>\n  <li>Wychavon District Council</li>\n</ul>\n</div>","first_public_at":"2026-02-05T13:30:00.000+00:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"opening_date":"2026-02-05T13:00:00.000+00:00","political":true,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"consultation_outcome","first_published_at":"2026-02-05T13:30:04+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-worcestershire","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-worcestershire","base_path":"/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-worcestershire","content_id":"2fd49834-d091-4946-9073-96fa637a12d7","document_type":"consultation_outcome","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-21T15:36:09Z","schema_name":"consultation","title":"Local government reorganisation in Worcestershire","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-worcestershire","withdrawn":false}],"children":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/consultations/local-government-reorganisation-in-worcestershire/proposals-for-local-government-reorganisation-in-worcestershire","api_url